CISION TO UPHOLD WAIVER FOR CP-KCS COMBINATION', 'text': 'STB SAYS TRANSACTION FALLS "NEATLY" INTO BOARD\'S RATIONALE FOR ADOPTING KCS 2001 WAIVER STB DECISION CONFIRMS THAT CP/KCS TRANSACTION IS END-TO-END WITH NO COMPETITIVE OVERLAP CP AND KCS LOOK FORWARD TO THOROUGH REGULATORY REVIEW AND DELIVERING BENEFITS OF THE COMBINATION TO ALL STAKEHOLDERS CALGARY, AB, APRIL 24, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ - CANADIAN PACIFIC RAILWAY LIMITED (TSX: CP) (NYSE: CP) ("CP") TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE SURFACE TRANSPORTATION BOARD ("STB") CONFIRMED THAT THE WAIVER IT GRANTED TO KANSAS CITY SOUTHERN ("KCS") IN 2001 IS APPLICABLE TO THE PROPOSED FRIENDLY COMBINATION OF THE TWO COMPANIES. CP AND KCS WILL PROCEED WITH AN APPLICATION UNDER THE STANDARDS SET FORTH IN THE STB\'S PRE-2001 MAJOR MERGER RULES.'}{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2021-04-26 14:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT FIRST TO GAIN OMNIAIR QUALIFIED TEST EQUIPMENT STATUS, ACCELERATING CELLULAR VEHICLE TO EVERYTHING (C-V2X) DEVICE CERTIFICATION', 'text': 'SANTA ROSA, CALIF. & ALEXANDRIA, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #5G--KEYSIGHT FIRST TO GAIN OMNIAIR QUALIFIED TEST EQUIPMENT STATUS, ACCELERATING CELLULAR VEHICLE TO EVERYTHING (C-V2X) DEVICE CERTIFICATION'}{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2021-04-26 09:01:00', 'title': "HOME CHEF® + SKINNYTASTE® TEAM UP TO MEET THE SURGE IN HOME COOKS' DEMAND FOR FRESH, EASY MEALS", 'text': "CHICAGO, APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --BY ALL ACCOUNTS, THE PANDEMIC-DRIVEN SURGE IN HOME COOKING IS HERE TO STAY, WHICH INSPIRED\xa0 HOME CHEF ®, ONE OF THE NATION'S LARGEST MEAL KIT DELIVERY BRANDS AND SKINNYTASTE ®, THE POPULAR RECIPE AND COOKBOOK FRANCHISE FOUNDED BY CHEF GINA HOMOLKA, TO JOIN FORCES IN MAKING FRESH, SIMPLE, DELICIOUS HOME COOKED MEALS EVEN MORE ACCESSIBLE. IN FACT, BOTH BRANDS HAVE SEEN THEIR CUSTOMERS AND COMMUNITIES GROW EXPONENTIALLY OVER THE PAST YEAR, AND WITH IT A DEMAND FOR A WIDER VARIETY OF LIGHTER, MORE BALANCED MEAL CHOICES."}{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2021-04-26 21:50:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC. - LDOS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF\xa0LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC.\xa0("LEIDOS" OR THE "COMPANY")\xa0(NYSE: LDOS).\xa0 SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S.'}{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2021-04-25 19:15:00', 'title': 'ROSEN, TOP RANKED GLOBAL COUNSEL, ENCOURAGES LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC. INVESTORS WITH LOSSES TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION - LDOS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - APRIL 25, 2021) - WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC. (NYSE: LDOS) BETWEEN MAY 4, 2020 AND FEBRUARY 23, 2021, INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), OF THE IMPORTANT MAY 3, 2021 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE.SO WHAT: IF YOU PURCHASED LEIDOS SECURITIES DURING THE CLASS PERIOD YOU MAY BE ENTITLED TO COMPENSATION WITHOUT PAYMENT OF ANY OUT OF POCKET...'}{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2021-04-25 12:31:00', 'title': 'CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT DEADLINE: KESSLER TOPAZ MELTZER & CHECK, LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT FILED AGAINST LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC.', 'text': 'RADNOR, PA., APRIL 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE LAW FIRM OF KESSLER TOPAZ MELTZER & CHECK, LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC. (NYSE:\xa0LDOS) ("LEIDOS") THAT A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF THOSE WHO PURCHASED OR ACQUIRED LEIDOS SECURITIES BETWEEN MAY 4, 2020 AND FEBRUARY 23, 2021 , INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD").'}{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2021-04-26 11:35:00', 'title': 'LINDE PLC: LINDE DECLARES DIVIDEND IN SECOND QUARTER 2021', 'text': 'GUILDFORD, UK / ACCESSWIRE / APRIL 26, 2021 / LINDE PLC (NYSE:LIN); (FWB:LIN) ANNOUNCED ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.06 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JUNE 17, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JUNE 3, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2021-04-26 08:00:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC PARTNERS WITH SURGICAL THEATER TO PROVIDE FIRST AUGMENTED REALITY PLATFORM FOR USE IN REAL-TIME DURING COMPLEX CRANIAL PROCEDURES', 'text': "DUBLIN AND LOS ANGELES, APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MEDTRONIC\xa0PLC (NYSE:MDT), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MEDICAL TECHNOLOGY,\xa0AND SURGICAL THEATER TODAY ANNOUNCED A PARTNERSHIP TO INTERFACE SURGICAL THEATER'S SYNCAR™\xa0AUGMENTED REALITY (AR) TECHNOLOGY WITH MEDTRONIC'S STEALTHSTATION™ S8 SURGICAL NAVIGATION SYSTEM.\xa0THIS COLLABORATION WILL ENABLE NEUROSURGEONS TO USE AR TECHNOLOGY IN REAL-TIME TO ENHANCE VISUALIZATION DURING COMPLEX CRANIAL PROCEDURES."}{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2021-04-26 09:00:00', 'title': 'CITYCENTER ENTERS INTO AGREEMENT TO SELL TWO-ACRE PARCEL LAND IN LAS VEGAS', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS, APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CITYCENTER HOLDINGS, LLC ("CITYCENTER"), A VENTURE BETWEEN MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL (NYSE: MGM) AND INFINITY WORLD DEVELOPMENT CORP, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO SELL ITS TWO-ACRE SITE TO 63SLVB, LLC, OWNED BY LOCALLY-BASED LONG-TIME NATIONAL RETAIL DEVELOPERS BRETT TORINO OF TORINO DEVELOPMENT AND PAUL AND DAYSSI KANAVOS OF FLAG LUXURY, FOR APPROXIMATELY $80 MILLION. LOCATED IN THE HEART OF THE ICONIC LAS VEGAS STRIP, THIS UNDEVELOPED PARCEL OF LAND SITS WITHIN THE CITYCENTER CAMPUS, ADJACENT TO THE SHOPS AT CRYSTALS ON THE CORNER OF LAS VEGAS BOULEVARD AND HARMON AVENUE.'}{'symbol': 'MCO', 'date': '2021-04-26 09:30:00', 'title': "REORG AND MOODY'S ANALYTICS COLLABORATE ON RESOURCES FOR CLO AND LOAN INVESTORS", 'text': "NEW YORK, APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- REORG , A GLOBAL PROVIDER OF CREDIT INTELLIGENCE, DATA AND ANALYTICS, AND MOODY'S ANALYTICS , A GLOBAL PROVIDER OF ANALYTIC TOOLS AND RISK ASSESSMENT CAPABILITIES, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THEY HAVE ENTERED INTO A DATA-SHARING AGREEMENT. REORG WILL SUPPLY SUBSCRIBERS OF MOODY'S ANALYTICS STRUCTURED FINANCE SOLUTIONS WITH REAL-TIME NOTIFICATIONS OF CREDIT EVENTS FROM REORG'S INTELLIGENCE PLATFORM IN EXCHANGE FOR MOODY'S ANALYTICS DATA ON CLO PORTFOLIO HOLDINGS AND COLLATERAL."}{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2021-04-26 16:05:00', 'title': 'NASDAQ ANNOUNCES MID-MONTH OPEN SHORT INTEREST POSITIONS IN NASDAQ STOCKS AS OF SETTLEMENT DATE APRIL 15, 2021', 'text': 'NEW YORK, APRIL 26, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AT THE END OF THE SETTLEMENT DATE OF APRIL 15, 2021, SHORT INTEREST IN 2,622 NASDAQ GLOBAL MARKETSM SECURITIES TOTALED 8,587,890,404 SHARES COMPARED WITH 8,451,076,714 SHARES IN 2,626 GLOBAL MARKET ISSUES REPORTED FOR THE PRIOR SETTLEMENT DATE OF MARCH 31, 2021. THE MID-MARCH SHORT INTEREST REPRESENTS 2.86 DAYS COMPARED WITH 2.54 DAYS FOR THE PRIOR REPORTING PERIOD.'}{'symbol': 'NTRS', 'date': '2021-04-26 10:00:00', 'title': 'THE NORTHERN TRUST INSTITUTE LAUNCHES TAX POLICY RESOURCE CENTER', 'text': 'CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NORTHERN TRUST (NASDAQ: NTRS) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE LAUNCH OF THE TAX POLICY RESOURCE CENTER, AN ONLINE RESOURCE DEDICATED TO EXAMINING THE INTERSECTION OF TAX POLICY AND COMPLEX WEALTH MANAGEMENT. THE CENTER, AN EXTENSION OF THE NORTHERN TRUST INSTITUTE, WILL PROVIDE RESOURCES THAT EXPLORE THE MANY FACETS OF PROPOSED TAX POLICY CHANGES AND OFFER EXPERT INSIGHT ON CORRESPONDING WEALTH PLANNING AND INVESTMENT STRATEGIES FOR HIGH-NET-WORTH INDIVIDUALS AND FAMILIES. CURRENT'}{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2021-04-26 10:00:00', 'title': "FLEISHMANHILLARD HIRES INCLUSION INNOVATOR, ADRIANNE C. SMITH, TO LEAD THE AGENCY'S DE&I STRATEGY AS CHIEF DIVERSITY AND INCLUSION OFFICER", 'text': 'ST. LOUIS, APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FLEISHMANHILLARD TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF ADRIANNE C. SMITH (SHE/HER) TO CHIEF DIVERSITY AND INCLUSION OFFICER, FROM WPP WHERE SHE PREVIOUSLY SERVED AS ITS FIRST GLOBAL DIRECTOR OF INCLUSION AND DIVERSITY.'}{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2021-04-26 08:00:00', 'title': 'SMALL AND MID-SIZED UNIVERSITIES CONTINUE TO ADOPT ORACLE CLOUD TO IMPROVE OPERATIONS', 'text': "AUSTIN, TEXAS, APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE HIGHER EDUCATION SYSTEMS & SERVICES (HESS) CONSORTIUM COLLECTIVE\xa0HAS SELECTED ORACLE FUSION CLOUD APPLICATIONS SUITE\xa0AS THE GROUP'S SINGLE ENTERPRISE RESOURCE PLANNING (ERP), HUMAN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT (HCM), AND STUDENT INFORMATION SYSTEM PLATFORM. ORACLE'S CLOUD TECHNOLOGY WILL ENABLE COLLECTIVE MEMBERS TO STREAMLINE THEIR FINANCE AND HUMAN RESOURCES PROCESSES ON A SHARED TECHNOLOGY PLATFORM THAT CAN HELP IMPROVE EFFICIENCY AND COST SAVINGS."}{'symbol': 'OTIS', 'date': '2021-04-26 06:15:00', 'title': 'OTIS REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2021 RESULTS', 'text': 'FARMINGTON, CONN., APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0OTIS WORLDWIDE CORPORATION (NYSE:OTIS) REPORTED FIRST QUARTER 2021 NET SALES OF $3.4 BILLION WITH 10.3% ORGANIC GROWTH.'}{'symbol': 'PKG', 'date': '2021-04-26 17:31:00', 'title': 'PACKAGING CORPORATION OF AMERICA REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2021 RESULTS', 'text': 'LAKE FOREST, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PACKAGING CORPORATION OF AMERICA (NYSE: PKG) TODAY REPORTED FIRST QUARTER 2021 NET INCOME OF $167 MILLION, OR $1.75 PER SHARE, AND NET INCOME OF $169 MILLION, OR $1.77 PER SHARE, EXCLUDING SPECIAL ITEMS. FIRST QUARTER NET SALES WERE $1.8 BILLION IN 2021 AND $1.7 BILLION IN 2020. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE ATTRIBUTABLE TO PACKAGING CORPORATION OF AMERICA SHAREHOLDERS \xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0 THREE MONTHS ENDED \xa0 \xa0 MARCH 31 \xa0 \xa0 2021 \xa0 2020 \xa0 CHANGE \xa0 REPORTED DILUTED EPS $ 1.75'}{'symbol': 'PG', 'date': '2021-04-26 10:00:00', 'title': 'P&G VENTURES ANNOUNCES ITS NEXT VIRTUAL INNOVATION CHALLENGE - INVITING ENTREPRENEURS AND STARTUPS TO PITCH THEIR IDEA FOR THE NEXT GREAT CPG BRAND', 'text': 'CINCINNATI, APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 P&G VENTURES, THE EARLY-STAGE STARTUP STUDIO WITHIN PROCTER & GAMBLE (NYSE: PG), IS NOW ACCEPTING SUBMISSIONS FROM ENTREPRENEURS, INVENTORS, AND STARTUPS FOR ITS NEXT VIRTUAL INNOVATION CHALLENGE. BUILDING ON THE SUCCESS OF ITS PREVIOUS INNOVATION CHALLENGES, P&G VENTURES IS ONCE AGAIN HOLDING THE COMPETITION VIRTUALLY TO MAKE THE CHALLENGE OPEN TO THE WIDEST POOL OF ENTREPRENEURS.'}{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2021-04-26 07:40:00', 'title': 'RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND AND ANNOUNCES 7 PERCENT QUARTERLY RATE INCREASE', 'text': "WALTHAM, MASS., APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES CORPORATION (NYSE: RTX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF 51 CENTS PER OUTSTANDING SHARE OF RTX COMMON STOCK, WHICH REPRESENTS AN INCREASE OF MORE THAN 7 PERCENT OVER THE PRIOR QUARTER'S DIVIDEND AMOUNT."}{'symbol': 'RHI', 'date': '2021-04-26 10:06:00', 'title': 'PROTIVITI NAMED ONE OF 2021 BEST WORKPLACES IN CONSULTING & PROFESSIONAL SERVICES BY GREAT PLACE TO WORK®', 'text': 'MENLO PARK, CALIF., APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GLOBAL CONSULTING FIRM PROTIVITI HAS BEEN NAMED TO THE \xa0BEST WORKPLACES IN CONSULTING & PROFESSIONAL SERVICES™ LIST FOR THE FIFTH TIME.'}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-04-26 10:00:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL ANNOUNCES FIRST SUSTAINABILITY-LINKED BANKING FACILITY IN INFORMATION SERVICES SECTOR', 'text': "NEW YORK, APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0S&P GLOBAL (NYSE: SPGI) TODAY ANNOUNCED ONE OF THE FIRST SUSTAINABILITY-LINKED BANKING FACILITIES IN THE UNITED STATES TIED TO CLIMATE ACTION GOALS VERIFIED BY THE SCIENCE BASED TARGETS INITIATIVE (SBTI) AND THE FIRST SUCH BANKING FACILITY IN THE U.S. MEDIA AND INFORMATION SERVICES SECTOR. THE NEW $1.5 BILLION SENIOR UNSECURED REVOLVING CREDIT FACILITY INCLUDES A SUSTAINABILITY-LINKED PRICING ADJUSTMENT TO REINFORCE THE COMPANY'S PLEDGE TO SUPPORT THE TRANSITION TO A GLOBAL NET-ZERO ECONOMY."}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-04-26 04:00:00', 'title': 'S&P DOW JONES INDICES LAUNCHES ESG DIVIDEND ARISTOCRATS INDEX SERIES', 'text': 'LONDON, APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0S&P DOW JONES INDICES ("S&P DJI"), THE WORLD\'S LEADING INDEX PROVIDER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF SUSTAINABLE VERSIONS OF ITS POPULAR AND WIDELY FOLLOWED DIVIDEND ARISTOCRATS FAMILY OF INDICES REPRESENTING MULTIPLE GEOGRAPHIES. S&P DJI IS INTRODUCING FIVE NEW DIVIDEND ARISTOCRATS INDICES THAT INCORPORATE ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) CRITERIA.'}{'symbol': 'CRM', 'date': '2021-04-26 08:00:00', 'title': 'SALESFORCE NAMED #1 CRM PROVIDER FOR EIGHTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO, APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SALESFORCE [NYSE: CRM], THE GLOBAL LEADER IN CRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT FOR THE EIGHTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR IT HAS BEEN RANKED THE #1 CRM PROVIDER BY INTERNATIONAL DATA CORPORATION (IDC) IN ITS LATEST WORLDWIDE SEMIANNUAL SOFTWARE TRACKER. SALESFORCE GREW ITS OVERALL MARKET SHARE POSITION AND INCREASED ITS REVENUE MORE THAN ANY OTHER CUSTOMER RELATIONSHIP MANAGEMENT (CRM) VENDOR.'}{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2021-04-26 11:19:00', 'title': 'SEMPRA ENERGY LAUNCHES EXCHANGE OFFER FOR PUBLICLY OWNED SHARES OF IENOVA', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO, APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SEMPRA ENERGY (NYSE: SRE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS LAUNCHED ITS EXCHANGE OFFER TO ACQUIRE ALL THE OUTSTANDING SHARES OF IENOVA (INFRAESTRUCTURA ENERGÉTICA NOVA, S.A.B DE C.V.) NOT OWNED BY SEMPRA ENERGY.'}{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2021-04-26 07:15:00', 'title': 'FINAL MODULE PLACED FOR VOGTLE 3 & 4 PROJECT', 'text': "ATLANTA, APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ALL MODULES FOR GEORGIA POWER'S VOGTLE 3 & 4 NUCLEAR EXPANSION PROJECT NEAR WAYNESBORO, GEORGIA, HAVE NOW BEEN SET AS A MASSIVE WATER TANK HAS BEEN LIFTED INTO PLACE ATOP THE UNIT 4 CONTAINMENT VESSEL AND SHIELD BUILDING ROOF. THE PLACEMENT ALSO REPRESENTS THE LAST MAJOR CRANE LIFT AT THE PROJECT SITE."}{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2021-04-26 07:00:00', 'title': 'VOGTLE UNIT 3 BEGINS HOT FUNCTIONAL TESTING', 'text': 'ATLANTA, APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GEORGIA POWER TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT HOT FUNCTIONAL TESTING HAS BEGUN FOR VOGTLE UNIT 3. HOT FUNCTIONAL TESTING MARKS THE LAST SERIES OF MAJOR TESTS UNDERWAY FOR THE NEW NUCLEAR UNIT AHEAD OF INITIAL FUEL LOAD.'}{'symbol': 'SYK', 'date': '2021-04-26 10:00:00', 'title': 'STRYKER TO PARTICIPATE IN THE BANK OF AMERICA SECURITIES 2021 VIRTUAL HEALTH CARE CONFERENCE', 'text': 'KALAMAZOO, MICHIGAN, APRIL 26, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- STRYKER (NYSE:SYK) WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE BANK OF AMERICA SECURITIES 2021 VIRTUAL HEALTH CARE CONFERENCE ON TUESDAY, MAY 11, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'SYY', 'date': '2021-04-26 08:00:00', 'title': 'GUEST SUPPLY AND VOLARA PARTNER TO INTRODUCE GOOGLE FOR HOTELS, A VOICE FIRST CONTACTLESS GUEST INFORMATION & SERVICES SOLUTION TO HOTELS ACROSS THE UNITED STATES', 'text': 'A SEAMLESS, CONTACTLESS GUEST EXPERIENCE VIA ENTERPRISE GRADE APPLICATION ON FAMILIAR GOOGLE NEST HUB A SEAMLESS, CONTACTLESS GUEST EXPERIENCE VIA ENTERPRISE GRADE APPLICATION ON FAMILIAR GOOGLE NEST HUB'}{'symbol': 'TRV', 'date': '2021-04-26 09:30:00', 'title': 'TRAVELERS REIMAGINES MYTRAVELERS® APP FOR PERSONAL INSURANCE CUSTOMERS', 'text': "HARTFORD, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE TRAVELERS COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE: TRV) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS RELEASED A NEW AND REIMAGINED MYTRAVELERS® APP, THE COMPANY'S MOBILE APP FOR PERSONAL INSURANCE CUSTOMERS, TO MAKE IT EASIER THAN EVER TO CONNECT WITH TRAVELERS. MYTRAVELERS, WHICH ALREADY PROVIDES 24-HOUR ACCESS TO INFORMATION AND SERVICES THAT HELP USERS EFFICIENTLY MANAGE THEIR POLICIES, NOW OFFERS NEW AND REDESIGNED FEATURES THAT ALLOW CUSTOMERS TO: REQUEST ROADSIDE ASSISTANCE AND TRACK T"}{'symbol': 'UNH', 'date': '2021-04-26 11:00:00', 'title': 'UNITED HEALTH FOUNDATION LAUNCHES $2.6 MILLION PARTNERSHIP WITH TOURO UNIVERSITY NEVADA TO IMPROVE MATERNAL HEALTH AND REDUCE DISPARITIES IN UNDERSERVED COMMUNITIES', 'text': "HENDERSON, NEV.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE UNITED HEALTH FOUNDATION, THE PHILANTHROPIC FOUNDATION OF UNITEDHEALTH GROUP (NYSE: UNH), IS PARTNERING WITH TOURO UNIVERSITY NEVADA (TOURO) TO IMPROVE ACCESS TO HIGH-QUALITY PRENATAL CARE FOR UNDERSERVED AND HOMELESS WOMEN IN SOUTHERN NEVADA. 